 *  3. Retrieve the search history by ID as member1 (should succeed, expect details).
 *  4. Register a new admin (admin1).
 *  5. As admin1 (switch authentication if necessary), retrieve the same search history by ID (should succeed, since admin has access).
 *  6. Register another new member (member2).
 *  7. As member2, attempt to retrieve member1's search history by ID (should fail: 404 or permission error).
